 ∆BuildList←{
⍝ Returns the contents of an "apl-buildlist.json" carrying ⍵, a package ID, as its only principal
⍝ package. Used to set up a pair of folders for testing what a re-install would replace.
     ns←⎕NS''
     ns.packageID←,⊆⍵
     ns.principal←,1
     ns.url←,⊂'https://tatin.dev/'
     ⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')('Compact' 0)⊢ns
 }
